  "description": "A .NET library for DIF Presentation Exchange 2.1.1 specification\n                        implementation. Provides intelligent credential selection, query processing,\n                        and presentation submission for SD-JWT ecosystems with support for complex\n                        constraint evaluation, predicate-based filtering, credential status\n                        validation, and submission requirements. Features predicate filters for\n                        privacy-preserving age verification, range proofs, and zero-knowledge\n                        constraints. Fully compliant with DIF PE v2.1.1 specification with\n                        comprehensive credential status checking via OAuth Status List v13. Ready\n                        for .NET 10.",
  "id": "SdJwt.Net.PresentationExchange",
